Current issues:
•	Flee currently returns the player to the map rather than directly to the room interaction menu.
•	Shimmer has no concrete usable skill yet.
•	NPCs still use placeholder messaging.
•	Inventory displays items and clues, but item usage is intentionally not implemented.
•	Interrogation success was not observed in this particular test run because the deterministic rolls produced failures.
•	Level-up behavior was not reached through the normal room rewards.
•	Room clues are generic: the first inspected object in a room may reveal the room’s clue regardless of which object logically contains it.
•	Enemy spawn conditions are deterministic based on room identity, so a room will always produce the same spawn result each time it is first entered.
•	The game does not yet have a full multi-room progression or victory condition.
